      "source": "Provide the identifier, stored in the [`UILaunchScreenIdentifier`](information-property-list/uilaunchscreens/uilaunchscreendefinitions/uilaunchscreenidentifier.md) key, of one of the launch screen definitions in your [`UILaunchScreenDefinitions`](information-property-list/uilaunchscreens/uilaunchscreendefinitions.md) array.",
